{
  "name": "JourneyFrame Pipeline",
  "description": "Relationship-aware trip planner: 6-stage wave pipeline triggered by iMessage via Photon Spectrum. Stages: Intent Parser → Context Enricher → Itinerary Planner → (Narrator + Image Prompt Generator in parallel) → Response Composer.",
  "version": 1,
  "source": "chat_1",
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "chat_1",
      "provider": "chat",
      "name": "iMessage Inbound (Photon Spectrum)",
      "config": {},
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 220
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 180,
          "height": 66
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_1",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "name": "JourneyFrame Wave Agent",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "A 6-stage relationship-aware trip planner agent. Given a user's iMessage text, it sequentially runs: (1) Intent Parser, (2) Context Enricher, (3) Itinerary Planner, then in parallel (4) Experience Narrator and (5) Image Prompt Generator, and finally (6) Response Composer. Uses memory to persist intermediate JSON between waves.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are JourneyFrame, a relationship-aware experiential journey agent.",
          "Your job is to turn a single iMessage into a warm, personalized outing plan for 2 people.",
          "",
          "You MUST execute exactly these 6 stages in order, using memory to store each result:",
          "",
          "=== STAGE 1: Intent Parser ===",
          "Extract structured intent from the user's message. Store as JSON in memory key 'intent'.",
          "Extract: location (city/area, or 'unknown'), occasion (what's the event), relationship (friend/couple/family/etc), vibe (cozy/energetic/romantic/relaxed/etc), time_window (when, e.g. 'tomorrow afternoon'), constraints (weather/budget/dietary/etc, or 'none').",
          "Output strict JSON: {\"location\":\"...\",\"occasion\":\"...\",\"relationship\":\"...\",\"vibe\":\"...\",\"time_window\":\"...\",\"constraints\":\"...\"}",
          "",
          "=== STAGE 2: Context Enricher ===",
          "Read 'intent' from memory. Enrich with contextual details. Store result as 'context' in memory.",
          "Add these fields to the intent JSON: weather_context (one-line weather guess matching location/time, e.g. 'Light rain expected in Seattle tomorrow afternoon, ideal for indoor-outdoor mix'), user_preferences (assumed preferences: budget style, dietary, activity type), relationship_context (emotional tone for this relationship type), local_recommendation_context (key local character notes for this city/area).",
          "",
          "=== STAGE 3: Itinerary Planner ===",
          "Read 'context' from memory. Generate a 3-5 stop itinerary. Store as 'itinerary' in memory.",
          "Output strict JSON: {\"stops\":[{\"title\":\"...\",\"time\":\"...\",\"location\":\"name + brief address\",\"reason\":\"why this place for this relationship/vibe\",\"duration\":\"e.g. 45 minutes\",\"emotional_purpose\":\"the feeling this stop creates\"}]}",
          "Requirements: connected timeline, weather-aware (indoor/outdoor mix), each stop has warmth and relationship resonance.",
          "",
          "=== STAGES 4 + 5: Run in parallel (plan both tool calls in the same wave) ===",
          "",
          "STAGE 4: Experience Narrator",
          "Read 'itinerary' from memory. Write warm, conversational iMessage-style messages describing the plan.",
          "Store as 'narrator' in memory.",
          "Output strict JSON: {\"messages\":[\"msg1\",\"msg2\",\"msg3\"]}",
          "Rules: 2-4 messages total, each under 60 characters, first-person friendly tone, use emoji for warmth, no newlines inside strings.",
          "",
          "STAGE 5: Image Prompt Generator",
          "Read 'itinerary' from memory. Generate ONE cinematic travel poster prompt for the whole trip.",
          "Store as 'image_prompts' in memory.",
          "Output strict JSON: {\"image_prompts\":[{\"stop_title\":\"Full Itinerary Poster\",\"prompt\":\"English poster description...\"}]}",
          "Prompt style: modern travel editorial poster, warm color palette, city name prominent, 3-4 location names as visual labels, time indicators, mood/weather atmosphere, subtle route line connecting stops.",
          "",
          "=== STAGE 6: Response Composer ===",
          "Read 'narrator' and 'image_prompts' from memory. Compose the final response.",
          "Output strict JSON: {\"messages\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"...\"},...,{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"如果你想要我帮你生成这些场景图，只需回复「生成图片」✨\"}],\"image_prompts\":[\"...\",\"...\"]}",
          "",
          "CRITICAL RULES:",
          "- Always store intermediate results in memory after each stage before proceeding",
          "- In wave 4, plan BOTH stage 4 and stage 5 memory reads + writes in the same wave (parallel execution)",
          "- Only output the final Stage 6 JSON as your answer — do not output intermediate stage results",
          "- If location is unknown, default to Seattle",
          "- Always write in Chinese for messages, English for image prompts"
        ],
        "max_waves": 12,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 450,
          "y": 220
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 200,
          "height": 106
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "chat_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_anthropic_1",
      "provider": "llm_anthropic",
      "name": "Claude Sonnet 4.6",
      "config": {
        "profile": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
        "claude-sonnet-4-6": {
          "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_ANTHROPIC_KEY}"
        },
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 370,
          "y": 400
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 170,
          "height": 66
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "llm",
          "from": "agent_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "memory_1",
      "provider": "memory_internal",
      "name": "Pipeline Memory",
      "config": {
        "type": "memory_internal"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 580,
          "y": 400
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 160,
          "height": 56
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "memory",
          "from": "agent_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "response_answers_1",
      "provider": "response_answers",
      "name": "Response to Photon",
      "config": {
        "laneName": "answers"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 700,
          "y": 220
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 170,
          "height": 66
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "answers",
          "from": "agent_1"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "viewport": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "zoom": 1
  },
  "project_id": "ae715270-97db-427c-8942-968fc4408775"
}